 493  *==============================================================================
 494  *  2.2 Variables - Benchmark
 495  *==============================================================================
 496  *  Benchmark values of variables are parameters. Their acronyms are the
 497  *  corresponding variable names,followed by the letter "O".
 498   
 499  *==============================================================================
 500  *   2.2.1 Volume variables
 501  *==============================================================================
 502   CABXO(z)        Current account balance of region z in terms of the international currency (pseudo-volume variable)
 503   CO(i,z)         Consumption of commodity i by households in region z
 504   CGO(i,z)        Public consumption of commodity i in region z
 505   CIO(j,z)        Total intermediate consumption of industry j in region z
 506   CEO(j,z)        Total energy intermediate consumption of industry j in region z
 507   CMINO(i,z)      Minimum consumption of commodity i by households in region z
 508   CTH_REALO(z)    Real household consumption in region z
 509   DDO(i,z)        Domestic demand for commodity i produced locally in region z
 510   DIO(i,j,z)      Intermediate consumption of commodity i by industry j in region z
 511   DEO(ene,j,z)    Intermediate energy consumption of commodity i by industry j in region z
 512   DITO(i,z)       Total intermediate demand of commodity i in region z
 513   DSO(j,i,z)      Supply of commodity i by sector j to the domestic market
 514   DSO_I(i,z)      Supply of commodity i to the domestic market of region z
 515   DSO_J(j,z)      Supply of activity j to the domestic market of region z
 516   EXO(i,z,zj)     Quantity of product i exported by country z to country zj
 517   EXTO(i,z)       Supply of composite commodity i by region z to the export market
 518   EXTTO(j,i,z)    Supply of activity j to the export market i of region z
 519   G_REALO(z)      Current real government expenditures on goods and services in region z
 520   GDP_BP_REALO(z) Real GDP at basic prices
 521   GDP_MP_REALO(z) Real GDP at market prices
 522   GDP_BP_W_REALO  Real GDP at basic prices
 523   IMO(i,zj,z)     Quantity of product i imported by country z from country zj
 524   IMTO(i,z)       Quantity demanded of composite imports of commodity i by region z
 525   INDO(k,j,z)     Volume of new type k capital investment to industry j in region z
 526   INVO(i,z)       Final demand of commodity i for investment purposes (GFCF) in region z
 527   IT_REALO(z)     Real gross fixed capital formation
 528   KDO(k,j,z)      Demand for type k capital by industry j in region z
 529   KDCO(j,z)       Demand for composite capital by industry j in region z
 530   KSO(k,z)        Supply of type k capital in region z
 531   KSTO(z)         Total supply of capital in region z
 532   LDO(l,j,z)      Demand for type l labor by industry j in region z
 533   LDCO(j,z)       Demand for composite labor by industry j in region z
 534   LSO(l,z)        Supply of type l labor in region z
 535   MRGNO(i,z)      Domestic production of commodity i in region z exported as international margin services
 536   POPO(z)         Population in 2019
 537   QO(i,z)         Quantity demanded of composite commodity i in region z
 538   VAO(j,z)        Value added of industry j in region z
 539   KLEO(j,z)       KLE of industry j in region z
 540   XSO_I(i,z)      Commoidty i total production
 541   XSO(j,i,z)      Total output of industry j in region z
 542   XSTO(j,z)       Total output of industry j
 543   POWERQO(z)      Total power output in region z
 544   
