 546  *   2.2.2 Price variables
 547  *==============================================================================
 548   eO(z)           Exchange rate (price of international currency in terms of region z local currency)
 549   IRO(z)          Interest rate
 550   PO(i,z)         Basic price of commodity i in region z
 551   PO2(j,i,z)      Basic price of industry js production of commodity i
