2272   
2273   NOil_DIO(p_oil,j,z)             Intermediate consumption of non energy oil by industry j in region z
2274   NOilR_DIO(p_oil,j,z)            Intermediate consumption ratio of non-energy oil by industry j in region z
2275   
2276   NOilp_DIO(p_oilproduct,j,z)     Intermediate consumption of non energy oilproducts by industry j in region z
